### Register
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alek",
    "surname": "Karam",
    "username": "alek",
    "email": "alek@test.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "role": "student"
}

